# Cog language plugin – {{ .LanguageName }}

Language plugin for [cog](https://github.com/grafana/cog/), adding support for
{{ .LanguageName }}

## What's included

```
.
├── go.mod
├── language.go # Language implementation: your code starts here.
├── main.go     # Entrypoint: runs the process as a cog plugin
├── rawtypes.go # Jenny (ie: code generator) responsible for generating types. This is for you to implement.
├── README.md   # ← you're here!
├── templates/  # Directory used to store templates used by the jennies
└── tmpl.go     # Template-related utilities
```

## Building the plugin

```
go mod tidy
go mod vendor
go build -o cog-{{ .LanguageName }} .
```

**Note:** make sure that the resulting binary is accessible via the `PATH` or
use the `--plugin-directory` flag when calling `cog`.
